*      DOUBLE  PRECISION EXPONENTIAL FUNCTION-DEXP(3                         001
       LBL     DEX3                                                            2
       COUNT   25                                                            003
       ENTRY   DEXP(3                                                        004
       REM     SOLVEX**Y      WHEREX(MSP)=4),X(LSP)=4)-1                     005
       REM                          Y(MSP)=4)-2,Y(LSP)=4)-3                  006
DEXP(3 SXA     EXIT,4                                                        007
       STI     SAVEI                                                         008
       CLA     4)             X(MSP)                                         009
       TZE     EXIT                                                          010
       DLD     4)-3                                                          011
       STO     SAVEL                                                          12
       STQ     SAVEM                                                          13
       TSX     $DLOG,4        FIND LN OF X                                   014
       CLA     SAVEM                                                          15
       LDQ     SAVEL                                                          16
       DST     4)-5                                                           17
       DLD     4)-1                                                           18
       XCA                                                                    19
       DFMP    4)-5           Y*LN(X)                                         20
       STO     4)             PUT LN OF ANS IN PSEUDO                         21
       STQ     4)-1           AC, THEN GET ANTI-LOG (EXP) IN PSEUDO AC        22
       TSX     $DEXP,4        AND                                             23
  EXIT AXT     0,4            RETURN TO CALLER                                24
       LDI     SAVEI                                                          25
       TRA     1,4                                                            26
SAVEI  PZE     0                                                              27
SAVEM  PZE                                                                    28
SAVEL  PZE                                                                    29
       COMMON  -206                                                           30
  4)   COMMON  1                                                              31
       END                                                                    32
